 *
 * <p>In a production environment this class must enforce that the user making the request
 * is the owner of the account being modified.  The original implementation only compared
 * the contents of the request payload with the stored user record, which allowed an
 * attacker to change another user’s email address.  The patched implementation now
 * performs a strict ownership check using the authenticated principal supplied by
 * the servlet container.</p>
